    "heading": "Restrained [Condition]",
    "lineStart": 13532,
    "lineEnd": 13540
  },
  "section": "8.122",
  "rulesText": "While you have the Restrained condition, you experience the following effects.\n\nSpeed 0. Your Speed is 0 and can't increase.\n\nAttacks Affected. Attack rolls against you have Advantage, and your attack rolls have Disadvantage.\n\nSaving Throws Affected. You have Disadvantage on Dexterity saving throws."
}
